---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact — Little Wild Films" description="Start a film, visual development project, or collaboration with Little Wild Films." dark={false}>
  <main class="contact-page section-light">
    <section class="contact-hero"><div class="inner-page-kicker">[ 04 — Make something ]</div><h1>Have a story<br /><em>looking for a world?</em></h1><p class="contact-hero-intro">Tell us what you are imagining, what is still unclear, and what kind of feeling you want the work to leave behind. We will get back to you with a thoughtful first response.</p><a class="dark-link" href="/">Back to home <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
    <section class="contact-details"><div class="section-kicker">[ Start a conversation ]</div><div class="contact-details-grid"><div><span class="contact-label">General enquiries</span><a class="contact-email" href="mailto:hello@littlewildfilms.com">hello@littlewildfilms.com</a><p>For original films, collaborations, music videos, visual development, and carefully chosen commissions.</p></div><div><span class="contact-label">Based in</span><strong>India · Working worldwide</strong><p>Remote-first, with a small studio practice built around clear communication and intentional craft.</p></div></div></section>
    <section class="contact-brief section-dark"><div class="section-kicker">[ Helpful to include ]</div><div class="contact-brief-grid"><h2>A little context<br /><em>goes a long way.</em></h2><ul><li>What are you making, and why now?</li><li>What kind of support or collaboration do you need?</li><li>What is your timeline, audience, or intended release?</li><li>Any references, images, or impossible ideas already in the room?</li></ul></div><a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@littlewildfilms.com?subject=Little%20Wild%20Films%20enquiry">Email the studio <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
